{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31792","headline":"送觉兴上人归中条山兼谒河中李司空 · 贾岛","name":"送觉兴上人归中条山兼谒河中李司空","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又忆西岩寺，秦原草白时。\n山寻樵径上，人到雪房迟。\n暮磬潭泉冻，荒林野烧移。\n闻师新译偈，说拟对旌麾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}